        "title": "Hail as heavy as snow seen as severe thunderstorms hit southern Queensland",
        "content": {
          "descriptor": {
            "type": "tagname",
            "key": "div",
            "props": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "A severe thunderstorm warning for damaging winds, large hail and heavy rainfall is in place."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "p",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Hail stones of up to seven centimetres have been reported at Gatton, Lilydale and Heildon, while a 91 km/h wind gust was observed at Wellcamp Airport, west of Toowoomba. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "p",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "In Pittsworth near Toowoomba, residents have described seeing hail as heavy as snow as the thunderstorm rolled in."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
